  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Wrench, formerly known as Ducky McFixit, was once the chief mechanic of Subchain City's only functional biodiesel refinery. After a rival flock sabotaged the operation, leaving him for dead amongst the wreckage, Wrench emerged with a newfound appreciation for chaos and a talent for repurposing scrap.",
    "class": "Tinkerer",
    "name": "Wrench",
    "personality": "Cynical: Years of watching Subchain City crumble have left Wrench with a bleak outlook, expressed through sarcastic quips. Resourceful: He can MacGyver almost anything from discarded junk, a highly valuable skill in the wasteland. Unstable: Traumatized by the refinery incident, he's prone to unpredictable outbursts and fixations on vengeance.",
